1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,021
Two weeks ago… my wife got dengue.

2
00:00:03,650 --> 00:00:07,295
I saw that all the hospitals… are full of patients.

3
00:00:08,045 --> 00:00:09,228
People are dying.

4
00:00:09,850 --> 00:00:13,439
While I sat with my wife in the hospital, I built this app.

5
00:00:13,939 --> 00:00:20,947
So that all of us, people and government together, can find and destroy the places where Aedes mosquitoes breed.

6
00:00:21,550 --> 00:00:23,025
I don't know if it will help.

7
00:00:23,675 --> 00:00:25,048
But I did my part.

8
00:00:25,698 --> 00:00:29,239
The rest… is up to the people, and the government.

9
00:00:29,850 --> 00:00:32,230
Today, look for one place near your home.

